  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> slides down a rough incline of length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> and angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>. The coefficient of dynamic friction is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu_d\"></span>. The block starts from rest and reaches the bottom with speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. What is the correct expression for the energy dissipated by friction?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mgL\\sin\\theta -\\frac12 mv^2\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mgL\\cos\\theta -\\frac12 mv^2\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu_d mgL\\sin\\theta\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu_d mgL\\cos\\theta + \\frac12 mv^2\"></span></p></li></ol>"
